OL,3,GNEWSALocals reject petition to rename  
OL,4,Atwo areas of city                      
OL,6,FProposed name changes for two areas of 
OL,7,FCoventry have been rejected following a
OL,8,Fpublic vote.                           
OL,10,FThe majority of residents said they    
OL,11,Fwanted to keep the existing names of   
OL,12,FWoodlands Ward as well as Tile Hill and
OL,13,FCanley Ward.                           
OL,15,FA petition had called for Woodlands    
OL,16,FWard to be renamed either Broadvale    
OL,17,FWard or Eastern Green and Tile Hill    
OL,18,FNorth Ward. It also proposed renaming  
OL,19,FTile Hill and Canley Ward either       
OL,20,FWoodlands Ward or Canley and Tile Hill 
OL,21,FSouth Ward.                            
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
