OL,3,GNEWSALocals reject petition to rename  
OL,4,Atwo areas of city                      
OL,6,F"The report has concluded that there is
OL,7,Finsufficient evidence of public support
OL,8,Fto justify progressing either of the   
OL,9,Fname changes in the petition," said Liz
OL,10,FRead, head of electoral services at    
OL,11,FCoventry City Council.                 
